  "description": "The market looks primed for one last violent surge — a classic blow-off top that will lure in the masses… only to wipe out most of them. Here’s why this rally could be the most dangerous part...",
  "body_html": "<p>After watching the video, here are some examples of blow off tops…which preceded major meltdowns in their respective markets. If you have questions, feel free to ask in the chat, or leave a comment!</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-blow-off-top-before-the-crash/comments&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Leave a comment&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-blow-off-top-before-the-crash/comments\"><span>Leave a comment</span></a></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!i87c!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F94296021-aa25-42a0-8d2c-acc13fb4aa2b_859x568.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!i87c!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F94296021-aa25-42a0-8d2c-acc13fb4aa2b_859x568.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!i87c!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F94296021-aa25-42a0-8d2c-acc13fb4aa2b_859x568.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!i87c!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F94296021-aa25-42a0-8d2c-acc13fb4aa2b_859x568.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!i87c!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F94296021-aa25-42a0-8d2c-acc13fb4aa2b_859x568.png 1456w\" 